//  v2_01.14.00  | 23.03.2018  | KLCH   | Change: remove redundant configuration
//  v2_01.15.00  | 24.04.2018  | KLCH   | AddOn: Common_Delete_SCP_Patterns; Common_Copy_SCP_Patterns_Sealing
//  v2_01.16.00  | 10.07.2018  | KLCH   | AddOn: new time programs to Common_Sealing_GenerateTimeProg_SM1, .._SM2; redesign of Common_Sealing_GenerateTimeProg; Common_Sealing_DeleteTimeProg_SM1, .._SM2
//  v2_01.17.00  | 10.07.2018  | KTO    | Change: Modify handling of SCP patterns, add fixpos RefSCP and SyncSCP for saferobotics
//  v2_01.18.00  | 21.08.2018  | KLCH   | Change: rename Common_AddDevice_BLV1 to Common_AddInitiator_LV1 and check Option14
//  v2_01.19.00  | 05.10.2018  | KLCH   | AddOn: Common_AddValve_FDR1, .._1, .._2; Common_ActivateChannel_MaterialSupply1, ..2; Common_CheckChannel_MaterialSupply1, ..2

// Script includes all SubRoutines for common use
// like inserting channels and devices with their properties
// Also common configuration of fix positions and trigger setup

